<bx:include template="../partials/_head.bxm">
<bx:output>
<section class="c-about-hero">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row align-items-center g-5">
			<div class="col-lg-3 text-center text-lg-start">
				<bx:if len( data.author.getAvatarUrl() )>
					<img src="#encodeForHTMLAttribute( data.author.getAvatarUrl() )#" alt="" class="c-about-hero__avatar">
				<bx:else>
					<div class="c-about-hero__avatar">
						#encodeForHTML( data.author.getAvatarLabel().len() ? data.author.getAvatarLabel() : left( data.author.getDisplayName(), 2 ).uCase() )#
					</div>
				</bx:if>
			</div>
			<div class="col-lg-9">
				<p class="c-about-hero__eyebrow">About the Author</p>
				<h1 class="c-about-hero__name">#encodeForHTML( data.author.getDisplayName() )#</h1>
				<bx:if len( data.author.getRole() )>
				<p class="c-about-hero__role">#encodeForHTML( data.author.getRole() )#</p>
				</bx:if>
				<bx:if len( data.author.getAbout() )>
				<p class="c-about-hero__bio">#encodeForHTML( data.author.getAbout() )#</p>
				</bx:if>
				<div class="c-about-hero__extra">
					<p>I'm a senior ColdFusion developer who's been in the CFML trenches long enough to have opinions about all of it &mdash; from crusty tag-based components to whatever comes next. Most of my day job is stitching e-commerce platforms together (Shopify, Amazon, eBay, Walmart, and a few you've probably never had to integrate with) so that inventory and orders don't lie to each other.</p>
					<p>Outside work I build things nobody asked for. I wrote my own Express.js-style module for BoxLang because there were no alternatives, then used it to rebuild my own blog. I ported Zork.  When I'm not writing code, I'm reading Dungeon Crawler Carl, James S.A. Corey, or Rothfuss, min-maxing a City of Heroes build, or doing calisthenics because apparently that's a thing now.</p>
					<p>I like systems with real rules and earned progression &mdash; in games, in code, in most things. If it's held together with duct tape, I probably built the duct tape myself and documented why.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<!--- Latest posts by this author --->
<bx:if data.latestPosts.len()>
<section class="c-about-posts py-5">
	<div class="container">
		<p class="section-label mb-4">Latest Articles</p>
		<div class="post-list" style="max-width: var(--measure);">
			<bx:loop array="#data.latestPosts#" item="post" index="cardIndex">
				<bx:include template="../partials/postCard.bxm">
			</bx:loop>
		</div>
		<div class="text-center mt-5">
			<a href="/posts" class="btn btn-outline-custom">All Articles</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
</bx:if>
</bx:output>
<bx:include template="../partials/_foot.bxm">
